# Cloudflare Pages routing (200 = internal rewrite, URL stays unchanged).
# 1. Dynamic sitemap (Supabase live) served on the canonical /sitemap.xml URL.
# 2. Yandex ownership file on its EXACT verification URL: Pages normalizes
#    "*.html" to extensionless with a 308, which breaks verification — this
#    rewrite bypasses that normalization and answers 200 with the exact file.
/sitemap.xml /api/sitemap 200
/yandex_4778040ed943270f.html /api/yandex-verify 200
